86 /* The illegal-instruction trap uses fixup_exception() for kernel faults.
87  * This read therefore also works as a feature probe on pre-retention RTL.
88  * Separate early-clobber outputs keep the extable error and zero registers
89  * distinct even though both inputs start at zero.
